{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 1, "text": "อยู่ตรงนี่นะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 2, "text": "ฉันว่าฉันเผลอทำอะไรตกไว้ เดี๋ยวฉันกลับมา"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 3, "text": "แล้วเราจะได้ไปโลกอื่นด้วยกัน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 5, "text": "โอเค..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 8, "text": "มาเล่นกัน!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 9, "text": "ฉันต้องการเท็ดดี้ของฉัน!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 10, "text": "ฉันทำเขาหาย..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 11, "text": "หาเขาให้เจอ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 14, "text": "นี่.."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 15, "text": "คุณหาอะไรอยู่เหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
