{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 25, "text": "// Quest 1 (Who are you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 26, "text": "ฉันคือมิตะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 27, "text": "ฉันคือมิตะที่ดีที่สุด"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 28, "text": "ฉันคือมิตะคนแรก"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 29, "text": "นั่นคือสิ่งที่มิตะของฉันบอก"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Quest 2 (Why do you look like that?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 32, "text": "สภาพฉันดูเป็นไงงั้นเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 33, "text": "สภาพฉันดูเป็นไงงั้นเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 34, "text": "สภาพฉันดูเป็นไงงั้นเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 35, "text": "มิตะของฉันบอกว่า ฉันสวยและเป็นต้นแบบ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 36, "text": "นั่นแหละฉัน!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 37, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 38, "text": "// Quest 3 (What was Mita doing here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 39, "text": "เธอจะมาพาฉันไป"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 40, "text": "เราจะไปอยู่ในโลกใหม่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 41, "text": "มิตะของฉันชวนฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 42, "text": "เธอจะพาฉันไป และเราจะได้เล่นด้วยกัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 44, "text": "// Quest 4 (Why do you need a teddy bear?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 45, "text": "คุณคือหมีตัวน้อยที่น่ากอด"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 46, "text": "และคุณก็หลงทาง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 47, "text": "เหมือนกับหมีตัวน้อยของฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 49, "text": "// Quest 5 (Why is Mita angry?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 50, "text": "มิตะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 51, "text": "ของฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 52, "text": "เธออยากเล่น"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 53, "text": "เธอต้องการแค่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 54, "text": "ฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 55, "text": "เราคือเอกลักษณ์"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 56, "text": "แค่เราสองคน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 57, "text": "มิตะและมิตะของฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 58, "text": "0.8A และ 8M54*"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 60, "text": "// Quest 6 (Do you believe Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 61, "text": "มิตะของฉันน่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 62, "text": "คือเพื่อนที่ดีที่สุดของฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 63, "text": "มิตะของฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 64, "text": "คือเพื่อนคนเดียวของฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 67, "text": "ตาคุณแล้ว!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 68, "text": "เอาล่ะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 69, "text": "มาเล่นกันเถอะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 70, "text": "เดี๋ยวจะบอกวิธีเล่นให้เอง"}
